    "updated_at": "2026-01-16T11:36:55Z",
    "body": "Hi maintainers and @ericli-splunk, Thank You for reporting this issue and providing clear reproduction steps.\n\nI’d like to take a look at this problem. I plan to investigate where Black’s parser fails on backslash-based line continuations for target-version py313, understand whether this is a parser limitation or missing normalization logic, and then work on either a fix or a proper handling with a regression test.\n\nIf it’s okay with the maintainers, I’d be happy to take ownership of this issue and work on a potential solution. Please let me know if I can proceed.\n",
